@startuml
' Figure 26.9  Where agent payments protocols sit
' Reading order: top to bottom. A person's mandate sets what may be
' bought; the agent presents it to the merchant, who settles
' over the payment protocol. The permission check stays with Lakeshore's policy engine:
' payment is not permission.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Person" as P <<org>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Policy" as Q <<policy>>
participant "Merchant" as M <<ops>>
P -> A : Mandate
A -> Q : May it happen?
Q --> A : Permission
A -> M : Pay with mandate
M -> M : Settle
M --> A : Receipt
A -[$FAIL]> M : Over mandate
@enduml
